00:19:01.541 --> 00:19:03.708
- Tidak.
- Oke. Kau akan memilihku?

00:19:04.208 --> 00:19:06.041
- Ya.
- Terima kasih banyak.

00:19:28.041 --> 00:19:30.250
PALISADES SELAMANYA

00:19:37.958 --> 00:19:40.375
