00:20:22.541 --> 00:20:23.583
Aku segera kembali!

00:20:23.666 --> 00:20:25.166
Anak ini, ya…

00:20:31.208 --> 00:20:32.208
Hector?

00:20:32.708 --> 00:20:34.041
Hector?

00:20:34.125 --> 00:20:35.541
